# Language & Documentation

## English only (code)

All of the following MUST be English:

- Identifiers: variables, functions, components, files
- Comments and TSDoc
- Commit messages (when you write them)

**UI copy stays French** (correct accents and apostrophes). Do not mix French into code identifiers.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
/** Rejoint une salle avec le code */
export function rejoindreParCode(code: string) {}

// ✅ GOOD
/** Joins a duo room after normalizing and validating the invite code. */
export function joinByCode(code: string) {}
```

## TSDoc

Add `/** ... */` on stores, hooks, and shared utilities. Cover:

- Intent
- Inputs/outputs and constraints (e.g. session code format)
- Security notes (SecureStore vs AsyncStorage, tokens, deep-link params)

Skip TSDoc on trivial presentational components and obvious one-liners.
